+	// flip - the gather shader's tap offsets are applied in texture space (v down), the
+	// same space the mask is authored in, so the halo lines up with the splatted
+	// silhouette as-is. (A negation here was verified upside-down in the engine.)
+	return Vec4(fx * 2.0f - 1.0f, fy * 2.0f - 1.0f, 0.0f, 0.0f);
