-## 虛擬腳架（Virtual Tripod）
-
-操作者一停住，pose 完全鎖定，構圖穩如腳架。狀態機：**Moving → Arming →（持續靜止 Hold Time 後）Steady →（移動）Blending → Moving**。
-
-- 進入條件：速度 < `Tripod Enter Speed` 且角速率 < 0.8 deg/s（固定常數）。
-- Steady 期間錨點以 0.1 Hz 慢慢追 ARCore 的長期漂移，但在 0.5 mm／0.02° 的 dead band 內**逐位元不變**——手機放桌上時 transform 真的完全靜止。
-- 釋放條件：離錨點超過 `Tripod Release Distance`、或轉超過 0.5°、或速度超過 0.05 m/s（後兩者為固定常數）；之後用 `Tripod Release Blend` 秒的 smoothstep 混回即時 pose，混回途中再度靜止會就地重新鎖定，無可見跳動。
-
-| 屬性 | 範圍 | 預設 | 說明 |
+| Filter Mode | Off / One Euro / Cinematic | Cinematic | Off reproduces the unfiltered path exactly; One Euro = stages A+B+B'; Cinematic adds the virtual tripod. |
+| Position Min Cutoff | 0-10 Hz (slider 0-5) | 1.0 | Lower values kill more jitter while the camera is still. |
+| Position Speed Coefficient | 0-5 per m/s (slider 0-2) | 0.5 | How fast the position cutoff opens up with speed. Raise it if fast moves feel laggy. |
+| Rotation Min Cutoff | 0-10 Hz (slider 0-5) | 1.2 | Rotational jitter suppression while still. |
+| Rotation Speed Coefficient | 0-5 per rad/s (slider 0-2) | 0.1 | How fast the rotation cutoff opens up with angular rate. |
+| Resample Delay | 1-4 | 1.5 | Packet intervals of buffering used to hide network jitter. Higher is smoother but adds latency. |
+| Max Extrapolation | 0-80 ms | 0 | Milliseconds the pose may be extrapolated into a signal gap. 0 freezes on the last pose. |
+
+## Virtual Tripod
+
+Once the operator holds still the pose locks completely, so composing a shot is rock steady.
+State machine: **Moving -> Arming -> (after Hold Time of stillness) Steady -> (movement)
+Blending -> Moving**.
+
+- Entry: speed below `Tripod Enter Speed` and angular rate below 0.8 deg/s (fixed constant).
+- While Steady the anchor tracks ARCore's long-term drift at 0.1 Hz, but stays **bit-exact**
+  inside a 0.5 mm / 0.02 degree dead band — a phone on a table really does hold the transform
+  perfectly still.
+- Release: further than `Tripod Release Distance` from the anchor, or more than 0.5 degrees of
+  rotation, or faster than 0.05 m/s (the latter two are fixed constants). Release blends back
+  to the live pose over `Tripod Release Blend` seconds with a smoothstep; going still again
+  mid-blend re-locks in place with no visible jump.
+
+| Property | Range | Default | Description |
 | --- | --- | --- | --- |
-| Virtual Tripod | bool | true | 開關（僅 Cinematic 模式生效）。 |
-| Tripod Enter Speed | 0–1 m/s | 0.015 | 低於此速度開始武裝。 |
-| Tripod Hold Time | 0–2 s | 0.25 | 需持續靜止的秒數。 |
-| Tripod Release Distance | 0–1 m | 0.01 | 離鎖定點多遠釋放。 |
-| Tripod Release Blend | 0–2 s | 0.15 | 從鎖定 pose 混回即時 pose 的時間。 |
+| Virtual Tripod | bool | true | Master switch (Cinematic mode only). |
+| Tripod Enter Speed | 0-1 m/s | 0.015 | Metres per second below which the tripod starts arming. |
+| Tripod Hold Time | 0-2 s (slider 0-1) | 0.25 | Seconds of stillness required before the pose locks. |
+| Tripod Release Distance | 0-1 m | 0.01 | Metres of movement away from the locked pose that releases the tripod. |
+| Tripod Release Blend | 0-2 s (slider 0-1) | 0.15 | Seconds spent blending from the locked pose back to the live pose. |
 
