-| Control | PC → 手機 | 28 bytes | `0x54433350` ('P3CT') |
+| Smoothing Half Life | 0-5 s (slider 0-1) | 0 | Superseded by the Pose Filter; leave at 0. Above 0 it adds one more exponential smoothing pass after the filter pipeline. |
